# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Local release artifact (regenerate with `npm pack`)
*.tgz

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.log

# Local scratch
.tmp/
coverage/

# NOTE: lib/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# DeepSeek Harness's `dsh plugin` command is a bare pnpm forwarder with no build
# step, and pnpm 10+ blocks the `prepare` script of a git dependency until the
# user allows it in `allowBuilds`. A plugin with a build step therefore cannot
# rely on being built at install time, so the bundles are built here and
# committed. `.gitattributes` marks them generated so they do not drown a diff.
